#pragma once
#include "Modulation.h"

// Triad Time's TIME folders (0.13.0: 1,000; 0.14.0: 2,000 more): 3000 patterns from a generator trained on the time
// envelopes of Thomas's Gross Beat banks (2,183 different patterns: how long the runs between jumps are, what each
// run does, how the jumps go). Each folder leans on what Triad Time is best at (Thomas): repitching forwards or
// backwards by an octave or two, and 90-degree chops. Every pattern is new (none within 0.12 beats on average of a
// pattern in the banks, none within 0.2 of another), on Triad Time's grid (1/64 bar across, 1/16 bar down) and within
// one bar back. Made by tools/time-presets (generate.py, generate_more.py, header.py).
